.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
show \- Show a snippet (card + numbered commands)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshow\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a snippet (card + numbered commands)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Snippet name
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg show ubuntu\-setup
